      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "ThreshE",
        "name": "厄运钟摆",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "锤石会提升攻击伤害，攻击的间歇期越久伤害值越高。在激活此技能时，锤石会挥舞他的锁链，将命中的所有敌人带向锁链挥舞的方向。",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">被动：</span>锤石的攻击造成额外伤害，伤害值基于与他最后一次攻击相隔的时间。造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">1.7</span>到<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(1.7 + (90/120/150/180/210% 攻击力))魔法伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">主动：</span>锤石挥舞他的锁链，沿挥舞的方向<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">拉拽</span>或<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">推挤</span>敌人。还会对命中的敌人们造成持续1秒的20/25/30/35/40%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>和<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(65/110/155/200/245 + (60% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">被动伤害受益于已收集的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">灵魂</span>数量。</span>",
        "iconFile": "ThreshE.png",
